327
00:25:51.502 --> 00:26:08.846
Decision, Per-conversation sequence and client message ids; WebSocket gateways with durable store and pub or sub routing, replay on reconnect; derived, debounced presence; masked calling and contact-detail masking; order-scoped lifetime and 30-day retention.

328
00:26:10.196 --> 00:26:27.433
Related ADRs, ADR-270 Conversation sequence from the store; unique client message ids; sender sequence enforcement (L1); ADR-271 Stateless WebSocket gateways, PostgreSQL log, Redis pub or sub,

329
00:26:27.713 --> 00:27:00.795
replay by lastSeq (L2); ADR-272 Receipts as per-participant watermarks; typing ephemeral; ADR-273 Presence from rider location stream, 35 s timeout, 20 s grace; last seen UI (L3); ADR-274 Contact masking with normalisation and context rules; masked calling; report or block (L4); ADR-275 Retention: read-only +2 h, delete at 30 days, partitions by day.

330
00:27:01.075 --> 00:27:02.035
Requirements.

331
00:27:02.315 --> 00:27:06.795
R1 No duplicates, no reordering, no silent loss on any phone.

332
00:27:08.145 --> 00:27:13.670
R2 p99 delivery 1 s foregrounded; push within 5 s backgrounded.

333
00:27:13.950 --> 00:27:19.155
R3 False offline 1 per rider-hour; real departure shown within 60 s.

334
00:27:19.435 --> 00:27:30.251
R4 No personal contact details exchanged in ≥ 85% of leak attempts; zero masking of OTPs, AWBs, order ids.

335
00:27:30.531 --> 00:27:35.843
R5 Conversation data deleted within 30 days unless under a support case.

336
00:27:36.123 --> 00:27:37.531
Decisions in detail.

337
00:27:37.811 --> 00:27:40.286
Protocol (ADR-270).

338
00:27:40.566 --> 00:27:51.681
HELLO(lastSeq), SEND(clientMsgId, senderSeq, body), ACK(clientMsgId, seq), MSG(seq,...), RECEIPT(deliveredSeq, readSeq), TYPING.

339
00:27:53.031 --> 00:27:55.548
Gateways (ADR-271).

340
00:27:55.828 --> 00:28:05.471
Netty-based gateways, ~30k connections each, JWT per connection, 25 s pings, 1 h max lifetime, drain on deploy.

341
00:28:05.751 --> 00:28:08.204
Presence (ADR-273).

342
00:28:08.484 --> 00:28:17.017
Redis key presence:rider:id refreshed by the location pipeline, EX 35; close events start a 20 s grace timer.

343
00:28:17.297 --> 00:28:19.857
Safety (ADR-274).

344
00:28:20.137 --> 00:28:29.012
Detection runs in the chat service before storing; masked text stored and shown; original kept encrypted for 30 days for trust and safety.

345
00:28:29.292 --> 00:28:31.980
Retention (ADR-275).

346
00:28:32.260 --> 00:28:36.377
Daily partitions; object-storage lifecycle rules for photos.

347
00:28:37.727 --> 00:28:38.751
Consequences.

348
00:28:39.031 --> 00:28:46.733
Every send is a database transaction on the conversation row: fine for 2 to 3 participants, not for large groups.

349
00:28:47.013 --> 00:28:51.301
Presence lags real departures by ~20 to 35 s.

350
00:28:51.581 --> 00:28:53.330
Masking can't catch everything.

351
00:28:53.610 --> 00:29:01.077
In return: consistent conversations on bad networks, reconnects to any node, calm presence, and privacy by default.

